WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.720
Seven children are playing. Five friends arrive and join them.

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:07.712
Seven plus five equals twelve children altogether.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:11.925
Fourteen bananas are in a bowl. Six are taken away.

00:00:12.783 --> 00:00:16.261
Fourteen minus six equals eight bananas left in the bowl.
